            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[New: Tikana keeps the folders you choose tidy. Each file that arrives is matched against your rules, and a rule moves its files only once you approve it.
Every move is listed in Done, with Undo.
With a Claude key of your own, Claude suggests rules for the files none claims.
]]></description>
